[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817310175","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2817310175","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2817310175,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n7L3f","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T19:39:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T14:04:33Z","body":"I noticed that this effect does not occur during the first window render. That is, the window will be properly resized the first time. Most likely, something is initially called that updates the render size.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5e282034-b414-4962-bf8f-d15fee9c706c","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817310175/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818013211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2818013211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2818013211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n93gb","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T09:19:34Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T09:19:34Z","body":"I’ve conducted additional tests with RenderingServer, DisplayServer, and Viewport, but so far I haven’t found a solution or trigger that would force the window to update in a way that bypasses this effect. I also tried changing the Viewport size after resizing the window, but the render size didn’t update as a result - and the black borders are still displayed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818013211/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818045402","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2818045402","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2818045402,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n9_Xa","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T09:37:15Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T09:41:53Z","body":"I checked the stretch parameter and noticed that in integer mode the window behaves incorrectly on the first launch and resize, whereas in fractional mode it works correctly the first time. On subsequent resizes, the behavior is equally incorrect.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818045402/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818145496","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2818145496","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2818145496,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n-XzY","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T10:38:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T21:23:59Z","body":"I think the problem is deeper and I understand it. I still don't believe there are any layers other than the viewport affecting the render size. Run a small test, if you simply use this code:\n```gdscript\nvar newSize: Vector2i = <size>\nvar viewport = get_viewport().get_viewport_rid()\nRenderingServer.viewport_set_size(viewport,newSize.x,newSize.y)\n```\nit will change the viewport size, which seems correct to me. If it was 1280x768 and became 1920x1080, the viewport should become smaller since the area increased. However, on both Windows and Linux, when the window size changes, the viewport will return to its original form (I don't think it should behave like this). This closely resembles the initial problem, so there’s reason to believe that when the window size changes, the viewport size is also changed, but on Windows, the size update is triggered, while on Linux, it doesn't work, and that’s why when the window size changes, it reverts to its normal form. Correct me if I'm wrong anywhere, but it seems to add up.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818145496/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818344257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2818344257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2818344257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n_IVB","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-21T12:46:47Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T21:23:56Z","body":"I found only one trigger to solve this issue - changing the window mode. This action forces the render size to update. It works only when increasing the window size and will trigger a render size refresh. However, using a smaller resolution requires a workaround: you need to apply the same trick but temporarily switch to a resolution even smaller than the target one - for example, going from 1920x1080 to 1280x768 should be done via something like 1024x768. This will also trigger the render size update in the same way.\n```gdscript\nfunc changeResolution(index: int) -> void:\n\tGlobal.setWindowSize(Vector2i(1024, 768)) # This is required to allow shrinking to a smaller size\n\tGlobal.setWindowSize(<new size>)\n\tDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN) # This is required to trigger the update\n\tDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_WINDOWED)\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2818344257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822517264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2822517264","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2822517264,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oPDIQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T21:24:51Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T21:24:51Z","body":"@miruji PS: In the future, please use the **Edit** button (located behind the **…** icon in the top-right corner of your comments) instead of multi-posting.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822517264/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829071533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2829071533","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2829071533,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ooDSt","user":{"login":"Blayer98","id":6663677,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjM2Nzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6663677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98","html_url":"https://github.com/Blayer98","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-24T23:35:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-24T23:38:09Z","body":"Hey, I'm using my Steam Deck with Godot (using Steam Play compatibility tool `Steam Linux Runtime 1.0 (scout)`), and it seems like this bug also occurs there, I think Desktop Mode uses X11 but I could be wrong. Here are my screenshots of a simple resolution selector I just so happened to be making while learning Godot. 😄 \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5fc876e7-2fda-4178-8bc1-74df26a88fbc)\nThe default layout is 1152x648. I decided to resize the window manually to something a lot smaller.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b21a2595-4589-4940-a3d9-d3a0dc40f4bf)\n\nAfterwards, I selected the 800x600 button, of which the following code and nothing else was performed:\n\n`DisplayServer.window_set_size(Vector2i(800, 600))`\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67c20182-f5e5-4f27-8349-dfcdf4e4f6fc)\n\nThat code resulted in this occurring, which I'm pretty sure isn't supposed to happen 😅 \nWhen I manually resize the window a bit, while the display looks like this, it updates and the window is displayed normally.\n\nI hope I was of help to anyone looking into this issue! 😃 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829071533/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831599789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2831599789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2831599789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oxsit","user":{"login":"Blayer98","id":6663677,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NjM2Nzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6663677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98","html_url":"https://github.com/Blayer98","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blayer98/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T23:27:36Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T23:28:07Z","body":"Hi again, so I made 2 builds of the project I made above, one with Windows and one with Linux, and while the Linux version still has the issues, the Windows build running under protontricks and wine did not have any issues with the Display whatsoever, and correctly updated to the 800x600 resolution (as well as the others) without me needing to move or resize the window manually.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831599789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2976923877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-2976923877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":2976923877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xcEDl","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://