it explicitly says in the docs:\n\n> **Note:** It's recommended to change this value using Window.size instead.\n\nand when I switched to:\n`get_window().size = ...`\neverything started working as expected.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4416300071/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5654200565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-5654200565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":5654200565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUQRA9Q","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-13T15:28:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T15:28:37Z","body":"> Not sure if this helps you, but it did work for me. I had (in GDScript): `DisplayServer.window_set_size(...)` and that failed, but I noticed it explicitly says in the docs:\n\nI described this in the PR, but it seems that `get_window().size = ...` actually works always.\n\nTherefore, this can be considered a solution to this Issue until the PR is accepted.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5654200565/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6203975381","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105597#issuecomment-6203975381","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105597","id":6203975381,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcckm1Q","user":{"login":"SteindelSE","id":88400258,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDAwMjU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88400258?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE","html_url":"https://github.com/SteindelSE","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SteindelSE/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T22:55:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T23:02:57Z","body":"Can confirm this still happens on `v4.7.2.stable.mono.arch_linux [ed1daf0bf]`\n\n`get_window().size = ...` does not work as a workaround in my case. It makes the window arbitrarily bigger once (not based on the selected resolution) and then proceeds to have no further effect.\n\n## Game window at start looks fine\n\n<img width=\"1162\" height=\"696\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92ae571a-56ec-4b10-b217-4fc861f494a8\" />\n\n## Resolution is increased and view is fine\nThe resolution is changed via `DisplayServer.WindowSetSize()`\n\n<img width=\"1925\" height=\"1123\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/352f51bd-bf94-40c0-9b15-9380b2a7f72d\" />\n\n## Resolution is decreased and view become distorted\nThe resolution is changed via `DisplayServer.WindowSetSize()`\n\n<img width=\"1288\" height=\"770\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71b2c6cf-b849-4ea7-85b7-6637669c27f2\" />\n\n## View stays distorted, allowing misinputs, until the window is dragged, then it corrects itself\n\n<img width=\"1287\" height=\"769\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1cbde255-ab37-4c44-9eb4-1db0b57b40a7\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6203975381/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]